    "subtitle": "Loopback co-frontend for the pi agent — v3.1 (2026-08-18): TUI owns conversation + tool logs; webui owns interaction. FOUR hash-addressable tabs (#inbox #report #data #btw) in a full-bleed 100dvh shell; Report = two-door producer (webui_report + POST /api/report → shared builder) with JSONL persistence AND cleanup (DELETE routes, per-article x, clear-all, mirror compaction); BTW = the REVERSE ask direction (browser branch question → TUI bell → chat answer → resolve); Data = pipeline telemetry; audited live by the power-tool Playwright instrument (7 invariants + visual dogfood).",
